        "original_id": "b27224d6-7759-5b34-b32b-cb5e26617996",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robin Wilson, Adrienne Bailon, Steve French, Ciara\n- Bands and groups: Gin Blossoms, Starclub, The Longshadows, The Cheetah Girls\n- Roles: lead vocalist, singer-songwriter, recording artist, actress, dancer, television personality, composer, producer\n- Works: All You've Got\n\nFacts:\n- Robin Wilson was born on July 12, 1965, and he is an American musician.\n- Robin Wilson is most notable for serving as the lead vocalist of the rock band Gin Blossoms.\n- Adrienne Eliza Houghton, née Bailon, was born on October 24, 1983, and she is an American singer-songwriter, recording artist, actress, dancer, and television personality.\n- The Longshadows were a musical collaboration between Gin Blossoms vocalist Robin Wilson and composer-producer Steve French.\n- Steve French was formerly a member of the Britpop band Starclub.\n- In the film All You've Got, Adrienne Bailon of the pop group The Cheetah Girls stars as Gabby.\n- In All You've Got, Ciara made her film debut as Becca Watley.",
